WEBVTT

00:10.370 --> 00:12.740
Are you concerned about the Oni?

00:16.010 --> 00:19.780
In Japan, demons are known as Oni.

00:20.320 --> 00:21.250
Oni?

00:24.050 --> 00:29.190
However, Monado Aria doesn't appear intent on taking any action yet.

00:29.190 --> 00:34.200
It is up to the master to choose the servant.

00:34.200 --> 00:37.290
What a complicated situation.

00:38.730 --> 00:42.930
What did the main branch say about Drei's retrieval?

00:43.300 --> 00:44.930
Nothing yet.

00:46.040 --> 00:47.770
That's not like the main branch.

00:49.140 --> 00:50.670
Don't you think?

00:52.210 --> 00:54.180
I'll continue asking.

00:55.880 --> 00:57.050
Don't go.

00:59.820 --> 01:00.980
You can't...

01:01.560 --> 01:04.150
You're the only one who can't leave me.

01:07.400 --> 01:08.230
Yes.

02:39.950 --> 02:43.660
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

02:43.660 --> 02:45.250
...been sealed...

02:53.970 --> 02:55.400
<i>Wait!</i>

02:56.170 --> 02:59.210
<i>Why? I want to be close by.</i>

02:59.210 --> 03:03.110
<i>I care so much... So, why?</i>

03:03.650 --> 03:05.410
<i>Why do I...</i>

03:18.060 --> 03:21.360
The

03:18.060 --> 03:21.360
Demon's

03:18.060 --> 03:21.360
Tradition

03:29.470 --> 03:31.670
It's okay, O-chan.

03:33.240 --> 03:36.370
But something's different from usual.

03:37.150 --> 03:39.550
I wonder what this feeling is.

04:30.700 --> 04:32.360
<i>Is that me?</i>

04:32.870 --> 04:35.000
<i>No, it's not.</i>

04:40.380 --> 04:42.840
<i>Who are you?</i>

04:52.320 --> 04:55.320
My bad, my bad!
I was sleeping so heavily.

04:55.320 --> 04:58.130
You're powerful when it comes to sleeping, as well.

04:58.130 --> 05:00.890
Honestly, what a sleeping face.

05:01.900 --> 05:03.920
I thought it was normal.

05:04.270 --> 05:07.900
Now, now. I'll put on some strong green tea.

05:07.900 --> 05:10.740
When I think that this is going to continue every night...

05:11.110 --> 05:12.270
You're a man, right?

05:12.270 --> 05:13.740
Don't worry about the small things.

05:14.240 --> 05:15.640
What's your problem?!

05:16.440 --> 05:19.470
I was so close to figuring something out.

05:21.450 --> 05:23.020
What's up, Tamaki?

05:23.020 --> 05:25.120
You haven't dressed yet?

05:25.120 --> 05:26.380
It's already time for breakfast.

05:27.420 --> 05:28.980
Huh? No!

05:31.360 --> 05:32.620
Was it me?

05:33.530 --> 05:35.390
Did I do something wrong?

05:36.160 --> 05:37.720
I'm off.

05:45.840 --> 05:46.810
What is it?

05:46.810 --> 05:51.010
I was just thinking you've really matured.

05:51.350 --> 05:53.180
I'm happy and I'm sad.

05:53.180 --> 05:55.620
As your older sister, it's a little complicated.

05:55.850 --> 05:56.720
Excuse me?

05:56.720 --> 05:59.820
Come on, don't play dumb.

05:59.820 --> 06:02.190
So, who is it?

06:02.190 --> 06:06.960
Everyone saw you come to school together.

06:07.360 --> 06:10.000
What? No! That's not-

06:10.000 --> 06:12.470
Ohmi was there too, wasn't he?

06:12.470 --> 06:14.500
You're living together now, right?

06:14.500 --> 06:15.740
Right, right?

06:15.740 --> 06:17.510
You know about Suguru?

06:17.510 --> 06:19.470
What? No, no, no!

06:19.870 --> 06:23.180
That aside, I deduce that something

06:23.180 --> 06:26.850
happened between you and the boys last night.

06:26.850 --> 06:29.440
Care to explain in detail?

06:30.220 --> 06:31.950
Well...

06:35.860 --> 06:37.260
No comment.

06:37.260 --> 06:38.890
Keeping it a secret?

06:39.430 --> 06:41.200
Ah, the spring of life.

06:41.200 --> 06:44.030
I wonder, did I have a time like that, too?

06:44.030 --> 06:46.570
But those years will never return.

06:46.570 --> 06:49.000
Goodbye, blue spring!

06:49.000 --> 06:52.500
Kiyono, I don't think you're getting your English right.

06:56.910 --> 06:58.040
Delicious!

06:58.680 --> 07:01.880
Mitsuru's handmade lunches really are the best.

07:02.550 --> 07:04.080
Absolutely.

07:05.620 --> 07:07.250
It's very tasty.

07:14.600 --> 07:17.060
What part of this is a blue spring?

07:18.070 --> 07:19.190
Did you say something?

07:19.600 --> 07:21.770
You're not going to eat that?

07:21.770 --> 07:23.570
Then I'll take it.

07:27.480 --> 07:30.410
I'm the type who saves their favorites for last.

07:36.550 --> 07:38.120
No matter how hard you stare,

07:38.120 --> 07:39.180
I'm not giving you any.

07:39.820 --> 07:41.660
Hey, Mahiro.

07:41.660 --> 07:44.460
Stop wanting things that don't belong to you.

07:44.460 --> 07:45.790
You're so annoying.

07:45.790 --> 07:49.830
I was only trying to eat the leftovers to avoid being wasteful.

07:49.830 --> 07:52.330
Yeah, right. All lies.

07:52.330 --> 07:54.800
It's not a lie. It's the truth.

07:54.800 --> 07:57.100
No, it's a lie.

07:55.940 --> 07:58.070
No, it's not.

07:57.100 --> 07:58.070
It's a lie.

07:58.070 --> 07:59.070
No, it's not!

07:59.070 --> 08:02.100
They've gotten much closer, haven't they?

08:02.740 --> 08:03.540
You're right.

08:04.410 --> 08:07.010
For a moment, I wondered what would happen.

08:07.010 --> 08:08.780
But it looks like it will work out.

08:10.520 --> 08:12.920
Friendship is beautiful.

08:23.700 --> 08:25.930
But still...

08:25.930 --> 08:28.840
Ms. Fiona isn't coming back to school, is she?

08:28.840 --> 08:30.470
Now that we know she's part of Logos,

08:30.470 --> 08:31.840
I don't think she'll return.

08:33.340 --> 08:35.280
I still can't believe it.

08:35.840 --> 08:39.910
That saintly Ms. Fiona was a Logos?

08:40.180 --> 08:42.620
So then, Ms. Fiona- No...

08:42.620 --> 08:46.990
Vier was searching for something concerning the Tamayori princess.

08:48.390 --> 08:50.360
That line of thinking is probably correct.

08:51.390 --> 08:53.630
Now that you mention it,

08:53.630 --> 08:57.590
Ohmi mentioned that some of our information might have leaked to Logos.

08:59.170 --> 09:00.790
I don't want to believe it.

09:01.800 --> 09:04.370
And Ohmi is now...

09:04.370 --> 09:06.270
Investigating the Bureau of Medicine.

09:08.040 --> 09:11.340
The man named Ashiya is apparently a man we can't be careless with.

09:12.150 --> 09:15.680
It seems he can use Onmyoudou powers,

09:15.680 --> 09:17.520
and he's observing us.

09:22.760 --> 09:24.990
I like it less and less.

09:25.660 --> 09:28.130
Yeah. What a shady character.

09:28.560 --> 09:29.530
I'm home!

09:38.940 --> 09:40.910
Ah, hello.

09:42.410 --> 09:43.840
Your uncle is visiting.

09:49.250 --> 09:51.220
Ah, hello.

09:51.690 --> 09:53.050
Your uncle is visiting.

09:54.960 --> 09:56.360
What are you doing here?

09:56.090 --> 09:57.060
Now, now.

09:57.060 --> 09:59.030
Don't look so scary.

09:59.030 --> 10:00.650
We're on the same side.

10:01.260 --> 10:05.060
I've only come today to see how the Tamayori princess is doing.

10:06.400 --> 10:07.400
What'd you say?

10:07.400 --> 10:10.370
I've allowed him to visit as a guest, Onizaki.

10:11.240 --> 10:12.570
Ohmi...

10:12.570 --> 10:14.810
There are two seals remaining.

10:14.810 --> 10:19.110
If they are broken, then Onikirimaru will return to this world.

10:20.110 --> 10:22.640
We must avoid that no matter what.

10:24.220 --> 10:29.780
In order to do so, the Tamayori princess decided to accept the help of the state.

10:30.320 --> 10:31.230
Yes.

10:31.230 --> 10:32.330
But!

10:32.330 --> 10:34.230
That's hard to accept.

10:34.230 --> 10:36.390
This man seems two-faced.

10:37.230 --> 10:39.730
Couldn't I say the same about you?

10:39.730 --> 10:42.100
Everyone here is hiding a secret.

10:42.100 --> 10:44.160
The truth is shrouded.

10:48.480 --> 10:51.280
Everyone got quiet, didn't they?

10:51.280 --> 10:53.710
But that's wise.

10:53.780 --> 10:58.280
Especially since the situation has become worse than you think.

10:59.690 --> 11:03.680
Yes, if things continue, the entire
Shugogo house will be killed.

11:04.990 --> 11:06.150
I suppose.

11:19.670 --> 11:21.010
I won't...

11:21.610 --> 11:23.510
I won't let that happen!

11:25.480 --> 11:28.720
I'm still not much of a Tamayori princess,

11:28.720 --> 11:32.490
and it's all I can do just to not get in everyone's way,

11:32.490 --> 11:37.190
but, if I awaken properly, everyone will get stronger.

11:37.190 --> 11:39.160
We could even defeat the Logos.

11:39.660 --> 11:43.320
I'll definitely protect everyone.

11:47.000 --> 11:48.260
Excuse me.

11:52.510 --> 11:54.440
So cute.

11:56.980 --> 11:59.750
The situation is bad,

11:59.750 --> 12:02.240
but I still think there's something that can be done.

12:02.850 --> 12:04.920
As long as we have the
Tamayori princess,

12:04.920 --> 12:07.420
we have the trump card.

12:07.420 --> 12:09.790
Right, Ohmi?

12:14.200 --> 12:16.860
Why did I say something like that?

12:16.860 --> 12:19.460
I haven't even awakened properly.

12:21.900 --> 12:24.210
You haven't said anything wrong.

12:24.210 --> 12:27.140
That's right. Not a thing.

12:29.440 --> 12:30.410
Let's go.

12:31.410 --> 12:33.410
Where to?

12:33.410 --> 12:34.350
To the storehouse.

12:34.950 --> 12:37.020
We'll find out what we don't know.

12:37.020 --> 12:38.950
We need more information.

12:38.950 --> 12:41.020
Who said that again?

12:41.020 --> 12:44.010
We'll get stronger. You're the one who said to have faith, right?

12:44.460 --> 12:47.490
We believe those words.

12:56.140 --> 12:57.230
Thank you.

12:58.240 --> 13:00.810
Huh? I couldn't hear you.

13:00.810 --> 13:02.580
Couldn't hear it.

13:02.580 --> 13:04.410
Couldn't hear a thing!

13:08.950 --> 13:11.250
<i>Thank you, you two.</i>

13:14.260 --> 13:18.280
But I still don't really like this storehouse.

13:18.660 --> 13:20.090
Is that right?

13:21.260 --> 13:22.230
Yeah...

13:24.230 --> 13:27.070
I'll take these and investigate them outside.

13:27.070 --> 13:28.740
Okay...

13:28.740 --> 13:29.640
Me, too.

13:30.940 --> 13:34.440
These books are a little too difficult.

13:34.440 --> 13:36.410
Sorry, Takuma.

13:36.410 --> 13:37.950
Don't worry about it.

13:37.950 --> 13:40.210
So, I guess we just read all these from the start, huh?

13:42.350 --> 13:43.210
Yeah.

14:23.290 --> 14:24.690
Thank you.

14:24.690 --> 14:25.590
Yeah.

14:29.900 --> 14:31.020
Hey.

14:32.200 --> 14:35.870
You get along with Mahiro.
Do you like him?

14:35.870 --> 14:39.200
Huh? Wh-What are you asking all of a sudden?

14:40.010 --> 14:42.980
Well, no reason, really.

14:51.390 --> 14:52.150
Jeez...

14:52.390 --> 14:55.150
What's Takuma's problem?

14:57.660 --> 14:58.680
This is...

15:00.160 --> 15:01.200
What's wrong, Tamaki?

15:01.200 --> 15:03.890
The daughter of Tamayori slays the Oni...

15:04.500 --> 15:07.000
Attended by the three gods.

15:07.000 --> 15:11.000
An Oni appeared on the sealing grounds and rampaged.

15:12.770 --> 15:15.680
The three gods dwelling there...

15:15.680 --> 15:16.240
Tamaki...

15:16.240 --> 15:17.580
...namely,

15:17.580 --> 15:21.850
Kuuso-no-mikoto, the Yatagarasu...

15:24.850 --> 15:26.480
Gentouka, the Youko...

15:28.860 --> 15:32.190
and Kodonomae, the Orochi, all fought against the Oni...

15:33.860 --> 15:37.420
but were defeated by the Oni's power.

15:40.030 --> 15:43.270
The three gods said to the Tamayori princess,

15:44.870 --> 15:48.080
"Teach us how to banish the Oni.

15:48.080 --> 15:52.380
The Oni grows stronger and will soon be beyond anyone.

15:53.480 --> 15:55.070
Someday...

15:58.550 --> 16:01.920
Someday it will become a monster that swallows the world."

16:06.090 --> 16:09.900
The Tamayori princess said, "I can help you,

16:09.900 --> 16:13.170
but if you use the sword, the seal will be compromised.

16:13.170 --> 16:17.240
You will be bound to this land forever

16:17.240 --> 16:21.970
to protect the sword with me.
Do you still wish my help?"

16:23.610 --> 16:27.740
The three gods made their pledge with the Tamayori princess,

16:28.420 --> 16:31.320
and fought with the Oni for seven days and seven nights.

16:31.320 --> 16:36.720
The Youko and Orochi lost their lives and the Oni was destroyed.

16:39.090 --> 16:42.360
To prevent the Oni from resurrecting,

16:42.360 --> 16:47.330
the Tamayori princess unleashed the sealed power and made it into a sword,

16:47.330 --> 16:49.330
and took the head of the Oni.

16:50.170 --> 16:54.610
Thus, the power of the gods was named Onikirimaru.

16:55.940 --> 17:00.510
As it was released to be used for good, the sword was once again sealed.

17:01.150 --> 17:03.810
But that seal was very weak,

17:04.390 --> 17:07.980
and would eventually lose its effect.

17:08.690 --> 17:11.090
The remaining Yatagarasu...

17:15.700 --> 17:18.360
Th-This is...

17:24.410 --> 17:26.370
T-Takuma...

17:26.670 --> 17:29.480
If what's written there is true,

17:29.480 --> 17:32.040
then I'm the cause of everything.

17:33.210 --> 17:35.050
The weakening of the seal,

17:35.050 --> 17:37.880
the Shugogo house being held here by the seal...

17:38.350 --> 17:40.510
How did you...

17:40.890 --> 17:43.050
Didn't you notice?

17:43.490 --> 17:46.520
You were reading that out loud.

17:47.590 --> 17:51.330
B-But this isn't necessarily true.

17:51.330 --> 17:54.960
No, it's true. It's familiar.

17:55.540 --> 18:01.570
Sometimes I have a feeling that something else is lurking inside me.

18:03.880 --> 18:07.810
I said the world is ruined.

18:09.280 --> 18:12.690
Lady Baba once told me long ago,

18:15.190 --> 18:18.520
that my blood is particularly thick with the blood of my ancestor.

18:31.770 --> 18:34.400
Wait, Takuma! This is...

18:34.910 --> 18:37.140
This is just a bunch of nonsense!

18:37.140 --> 18:38.870
Wait, Takuma!

18:43.720 --> 18:45.410
Takuma!

18:47.290 --> 18:48.490
Takuma...

18:48.490 --> 18:51.830
Since I was small, it was always there.

18:51.830 --> 18:54.850
Something strange sleeping inside me.

18:55.160 --> 18:59.120
Something I couldn't begin to control.

19:00.970 --> 19:04.370
As I grew, I was told it would get stronger.

19:05.010 --> 19:08.140
It was evil, and if it awoke,

19:08.140 --> 19:10.640
it would break everything precious to me.

19:10.640 --> 19:12.440
That's how I felt.

19:13.580 --> 19:14.950
Why only me?!

19:20.920 --> 19:23.260
There's an Oni inside me.

19:23.260 --> 19:25.280
It's not a guardian.

19:26.190 --> 19:28.200
Sealed by the Tamayori princess,

19:28.200 --> 19:30.560
it's an Oni that will destroy the world.

19:42.040 --> 19:44.440
It's okay, Takuma.

19:45.680 --> 19:48.240
It's okay, I'm here.

19:49.150 --> 19:51.280
What do you know?

19:52.290 --> 19:55.290
A monster is writhing inside my body.

19:55.290 --> 19:58.090
I can sense it so clearly.

19:58.730 --> 20:02.130
Soon... soon it will wake up.

20:02.130 --> 20:03.620
I won't let it.

20:04.300 --> 20:06.770
I'm the Tamayori princess.

20:08.570 --> 20:11.770
My ancestor banished that demon, right?

20:12.370 --> 20:14.240
Then, it's all right.

20:14.240 --> 20:17.680
I'll drive it out of your body.

20:19.410 --> 20:21.580
When I become the Tamayori princess,

20:21.580 --> 20:23.880
I'll free you all from that curse.

20:24.420 --> 20:27.150
I'll break your chains of duty.

20:27.590 --> 20:29.090
So...

20:29.090 --> 20:31.460
So, it's all right, Takuma!

20:36.860 --> 20:38.460
Thank you, Tamaki.

20:48.740 --> 20:49.840
Thank you.

20:57.180 --> 20:59.090
What a great sleep!

21:00.120 --> 21:01.390
Upperclassman?

21:01.390 --> 21:04.630
I was reading and started feeling so sleepy.

21:04.630 --> 21:06.090
Upperclassman!

21:06.090 --> 21:08.100
It's almost time for dinner.

21:08.100 --> 21:11.030
Ashiya has already left, so don't worry.

21:11.570 --> 21:13.190
Sounds good!

21:13.600 --> 21:15.740
You guys go ahead.

21:15.740 --> 21:18.230
I'll return the books to the storehouse.

21:19.470 --> 21:21.270
Man, I'm hungry.

21:21.910 --> 21:24.540
Mahiro, you'd better hurry.

21:24.540 --> 21:25.200
Yeah.

21:25.550 --> 21:29.080
And don't eat my meat!

21:29.080 --> 21:31.290
Yes, yes, I got it.

21:31.290 --> 21:35.350
Honestly, Mahiro, you're the one who always goes after others' food.

23:12.850 --> 23:16.980
The main branch orders the retrieval of the remaining Artifacts.

23:18.860 --> 23:22.800
And to continue to use
Drei for that purpose.

23:23.760 --> 23:25.560
What will you do?

23:25.870 --> 23:30.330
What is written in the black book is what will be done.

23:32.710 --> 23:36.800
Um, I made a chestnut cake.

23:37.180 --> 23:39.080
Would you like to eat it with me?

23:43.850 --> 23:49.650
I love it when you eat happily.

23:52.790 --> 23:54.820
Would it be all right if I watched you?

23:54.930 --> 24:00.990
Next Time: A Time for Battle
